<div>
  <h2>A limerick:</h2>
  <p>There was once was a teacher named Mark</p>
  <p>who shoved a carrot up his arse for a lark</p>
  <p>he pushed it right up, until it was stuck</p>
  <p>and now he can see in the dark</p>
</div>

